<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91172" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτέρ-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is feathered</i>, e.g. <i>feathered
			arrow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				139
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				56
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. βραγχίων</span> the <i>fin</i> by the
			gills of fishes, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				16.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>colonnade</i> of a temple, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				3.3.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.8.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερώματα πετάσου</span>”
				<i>awnings,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephes.
					2.41
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>plumage</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				246e
			</span></i>; in literal sense, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Col.</u>
				792a24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				b28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷον . . π. τῆς κινήσεως</span> motive
				<i>wingpower</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.586
			</span></i>.</div>
